helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155962				0	he	Select				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	he	To select an object on the current slide, click the \<emph\>Select\</emph\> tool (white arrow) on the Drawing bar, and then click the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610				0	he	To select more than one object, hold down Shift while you click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	he	To select an object that is behind another object, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click the object. To select the next underlying object in the stacking, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click again. To return the selection to the previously selected object, hold down Shift + \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	he	To add text to a selected object, double-click the object and type or enter your text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	he	To remove a selection, click anywhere outside the selected object, or press Escape.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B0				0	he	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10060000.xhp\"\>Rectangle\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C0				0	he	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	he	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10070000.xhp\"\>Ellipse\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	he	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				20200411 15:09:53
