helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	he	This section provides information on the subject of the Internet. An \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Internet glossary\"\>Internet glossary\</link\> explains the most important terms.				20200411 15:09:53
