helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id8644672				0	he	Double-click a data point to select and edit the data series to which the data point belongs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id6574907				0	he	With a data series selected, click, then double-click a single data point to edit the properties of this data point (for example, a single bar in a bar chart).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id1019200902360575				0	he	Double-click the legend to select and edit the legend. Click, then double-click a symbol in the selected legend to edit the associated data series.				20200411 15:09:53
