helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	יכולות ‎$[officename] Chart‎				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150543				0	he	\<link href=\"text/schart/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Chart Features\"\>$[officename] Chart Features\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	he	Charts allow you to present data so that it is easy to visualize.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	he	You can create a chart from source data in a Calc spreadsheet or a Writer table. When the chart is embedded in the same document as the data, it stays linked to the data, so that the chart automatically updates when you change the source data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153143				0	he	Chart Types				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	he	Choose from a variety of 3D charts and 2D charts, such as bar charts, line charts, stock charts. You can change chart types with a few clicks of the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149665				0	he	Individual Formatting				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	he	You can customize individual chart elements, such as axes, data labels, and legends, by right-clicking them in the chart, or with toolbar icons and menu commands.				20200411 15:09:53
