helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	he	If no parameters are passed, an empty array is created (like Dim A() that is the same as a sequence of length 0 in Uno). If parameters are specified, a dimension is created for each parameter.				20200411 15:09:53
