helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	he	In this example, the prefix is ContListener_. The following subroutines must therefore be implemented in Basic:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	he	ContListener_disposing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	he	ContListener_elementInserted				20200411 15:09:53
