helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156027				0	he	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03102900.xhp\" name=\"LBound Function [Runtime]\"\>LBound Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102900.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226				0	he	Returns the lower boundary of an array.				20200411 15:09:53
