helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	he	Tests if an expression is a number. If the expression is a \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp#dezimal\" name=\"number\"\>number\</link\>, the function returns True, otherwise the function returns False.				20200411 15:09:53
