helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	he	Converts a string to a numeric expression.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159157				0	he	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	he	Val (Text As String)				20200411 15:09:53
