helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id6591082				0	he	Setting this property to TRUE causes the changes to be automatically saved when editing is interrupted. FALSE means that editing is canceled and changes are lost.				20200411 15:09:53
