helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	he	Internal date number				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125864				0	he	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685				0	he	\<emph\>String:\</emph\> A string that contains a date in ISO format. The year may have two or four digits.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150439				0	he	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	par_id3147318				0	he	dateval = CDateFromIso("20021231")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030108.xhp	0	help	par_id3146921				0	he	returns 12/31/2002 in the date format of your system				20200411 15:09:53
