helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156344				0	he	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03060200.xhp\" name=\"Eqv Operator [Runtime]\"\>Eqv Operator [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	he	Calculates the logical equivalence of two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154367				0	he	תחביר:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	he	Result = Expression1 Eqv Expression2				20200411 15:09:53
