helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	he	Exits a \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\>, \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\>, a function, or a subroutine.				20200411 15:09:53
