helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150620				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170800.xhp\" name=\"Table Element Wizard\"\>Table Element Wizard\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155354				0	he	If you insert a table control in a document, the \<emph\>Table Element Wizard\</emph\> starts automatically. In this wizard, you can interactively specify which information is displayed in the table control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154422				0	he	You can use the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171100.xhp\" name=\"Wizards On/Off\"\>\<emph\>Wizards On/Off\</emph\>\</link\> icon to keep the wizard from starting automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
