helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153323				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170902.xhp\" name=\"Combo/List Box Wizard: Field Selection\"\>Combo/List Box Wizard: Field Selection\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	par_id3154228				0	he	Select the data field specified in the table on previous page, whose contents should be displayed in the list or combo box.				20200411 15:09:53
