helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_EDIT_RID_PAGE_LCW_CONTENTSELECTION_FIELD_ET_DISPLAYEDFIELD\"\>Specifies the field whose data are to be shown in the combo or list boxes.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	he	The field name given here appears in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control properties\"\>Control properties\</link\> as an element of an SQL statement in the \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
