helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154927				0	he	\<variable id=\"zeichenhintergrundtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BackColor\"\>Applies the current highlight color to the background of a text selection. If no text is selected, click the \<emph\>Highlighting\</emph\> icon, select the text that you want to highlight, and then click the \<emph\>Highlighting\</emph\> icon again. To change the highlight color, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Highlighting\</emph\> icon, and then click the color that you want.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
