helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	he	STD				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	he	Standard mode				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	he	Click in text where you want to position the cursor; click in a cell to make it the active cell. Any other selection is then deselected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763				0	he	EXT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149580				0	he	Extension mode				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	he	Clicking in the text extends or crops the current selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154047				0	he	ADD				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147620				0	he	Additional selection mode				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	he	A new selection is added to an existing selection. The result is a multiple selection.				20200411 15:09:53
