helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id5258644				0	he	A block of text can be selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20050000.xhp	0	help	par_id4441663				0	he	On Windows systems, you can hold down the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Alt\</item\> key while dragging to select a block of text. You don't need to enter the block selection mode.				20200411 15:09:53
