helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144740				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DSBrowserExplorer\"\>Turns on and off the view of the data source explorer.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Explorer On/Off\</emph\> icon is visible on the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0212.xhp\" name=\"Database Bar\"\>Table Data bar\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
