helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088	2			0	he	\<variable id=\"form\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormProperties\" visibility=\"visible\"\>In this dialog you can specify, among others,  the data source and the events for the whole form.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
