helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149987	2			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SortDown\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sorts the data of the selected field in descending order.\</ahelp\>Text fields are sorted alphabetically, number fields are sorted by number.				20200411 15:09:53
