helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	General				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153681				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"General\"\>General\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233	2			0	he	This \<emph\>General \</emph\>tab enables you to define the general properties of a form control. These properties differ, depending on the control type. Not all of the following properties are available for every control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	he	If you export the current form document to HTML format, the default control values are exported, not the current control values. Default values are determined - depending on the type of control - by the properties' Default value (for example, in text fields), Default status (for check boxes and option fields), and Default selection (for list boxes).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149734				0	he	Enabled				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ENABLED\"\>If a control field has the property "Enabled" (Yes), the form user will be able to use the control field.\</ahelp\> If the property is disabled, it will not be enabled (No) and will be displayed in a gray color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153320				0	he	Line count				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235	75			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LINECOUNT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies how many lines should be displayed in the dropdown list. This setting is only active if you chose "Yes" in the "Dropdown" option.\</ahelp\>For combo boxes with the Dropdown property, you can specify how many lines should be displayed in the dropdown list. With control fields which do not have the Dropdown option, the line's display will be specified by the size of the control field and the font size.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153147				0	he	Action				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149415	24			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_BUTTONTYPE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Action property determines the action that occurs when you activate a button.\</ahelp\>You can use navigation actions to design your own database navigation buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152474				0	he	The following table describes the actions that you can assign to a button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147303				0	he	Action				20200411 15:09:53
