helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153797				0	he	No action occurs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	he	Submit form				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228	31			0	he	Sends the data that is entered in other control fields of the current form to the address that is specified in \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\> under \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170201.xhp\" name=\"URL\"\>\<emph\>URL\</emph\>\</link\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F7				0	he	Enter the URL into the form's data property "URL" text box when you export to a PDF file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	he	Reset form				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155101				0	he	Resets the settings in other control fields to the predefined defaults (Default Status, Default Selection, Default Value).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431				0	he	Open document / web page				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	he	Opens the URL that is specified under \<emph\>URL\</emph\>. You can use \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> to specify the target frame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FE				0	he	First record				20200411 15:09:53
