helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143284				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>Form Navigator\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowFmExplorer\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> displays all forms and subforms of the current document with their respective controls.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	he	When using several forms, the Form Navigator gives an overview of all forms, and also provides various functions for editing them.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FORM_NAVIGATOR\"\>The \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> contains a list of all created (logical) forms with the corresponding control fields.\</ahelp\> You can see whether a form contains control fields by the plus sign displayed before the entry. Click the plus sign to open the list of the form elements.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	he	You can change how the different controls are arranged by dragging and dropping them in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>. Select one or more controls and drag them into another form. Alternatively use \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+X or the context menu command \<emph\>Cut\</emph\> to move a control to the clipboard and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V or the command \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> to insert the control into another position.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	he	To edit the name in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>, click on the name and enter a new name, or use the command in the context menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156347				0	he	If you select a control in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>, the corresponding element is selected in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	he	If you call the context menu of a selected entry, the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> offers the following functions:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153252				0	he	New				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	8			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW\"\>Adds new elements to the form. The\<emph\> Add \</emph\>function can only be called if a form is selected in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149763				0	he	Form				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156117	10			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW_FORM\"\>Creates a new form in the document. \</ahelp\> To create a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subform\"\>subform\</link\>, add the new form under the desired parent form.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155342				0	he	Hidden Controls				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NEW_HIDDEN\"\>Creates a hidden control in the selected form that is not displayed on the screen. A hidden control serves to include data that is transmitted together with the form.\</ahelp\> It contains additional information or clarifying text that you can specify when creating the form through the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Special Properties\"\>Special Properties\</link\> of the control. Select the entry of the hidden control in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> and select the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159147				0	he	You can copy controls in the document through the clipboard (shortcut keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C for copying and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V for inserting). You can copy hidden controls in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> by using drag-and-drop while keeping the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key pressed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	he	Drag and drop to copy controls within the same document or between documents. Open another form document and drag the hidden control from the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> into the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> of the target document. Click a visible control directly in the document, rest the mouse for a moment so that a copy of the control is added to the drag-and-drop clipboard, then drag the copy into the other document. If you want a copy in the same document, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>while dragging.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	he	Delete				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETE\"\>Deletes the selected entry.\</ahelp\> This allows you to delete individual form components as well as whole forms with one mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153799				0	he	Tab order				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156282				0	he	When a form is selected, it opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>\<emph\>Tab Order\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, where the indices for focusing the control elements on the Tab key are defined.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150869				0	he	Rename				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_RENAME_OBJECT\"\>Renames the selected object.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153194				0	he	Properties				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149766				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowPropertyBrowser\"\>Starts the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog for the selected entry.\</ahelp\> If a form is selected, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\> dialog opens. If a control is selected, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170100.xhp\" name=\"Control Properties\"\>Control Properties\</link\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Gamma				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154100				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/24080000.xhp\" name=\"Gamma\"\>Gamma\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafGamma\"\>Specifies the gamma value for the view of the selected object, which affects the brightness of the midtone values.\</ahelp\> Values from 0.10 (minimum Gamma) to 10 (maximum Gamma) are possible.				20200411 15:09:53
