helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id9462263				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter a URL for the file that you want to open when you click the hyperlink. If you do not specify a target frame, the file opens in the current document or frame.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145136				0	he	Open File				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095	7			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_DOCUMENT:BTN_FILEOPEN\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Open dialog,\</emph\> where you can select a file.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
