helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertDraw\"\>Click to open or close the \<emph\>Drawing \</emph\>bar, where you can add shapes, lines, text, and callouts to the current document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10849				0	he	You can switch on and off the Drawing toolbar of Writer and Calc documents using an icon on the Standard toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
