helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	he	On the ruler, set the tabs for the current paragraph, or all selected paragraphs, using the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	he	Initially the default tabs are shown on the horizontal ruler. Once you set a tab, only the default tabs to the right of the tab that you have set are available.				20200411 15:09:53
