helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN1088F				0	he	The HTML format is not an OpenDocument format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id4818872				0	he	ODF Chart is the name of the file format for stand alone charts. This format with the extension *.odc is currently not in use.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E3				0	he	Older File Formats Prior to %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id0514200811525257				0	he	The OpenDocument format evolves over time.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id0514200811565671				0	he	ODF version				20200411 15:09:53
