helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id0519200811530455				0	he	OpenOffice.org 1.1.5 or StarOffice 7				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id0514200811565787				0	he	ODF 1.1 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id0519200811530479				0	he	2007-02-02				20200411 15:09:53
