helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094				0	he	This page is only visible if the document is linked to a database. It specifies whether the reference values should be saved in the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153255				0	he	Indicate where to save the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"reference values\"\>reference values\</link\>. A reference value can represent the current state of the group box in a database.				20200411 15:09:53
