helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navpane_on.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	he	In the Help window, you can show or hide the navigation pane as needed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navpane_on.xhp	0	help	par_id3156411				0	he	\<image id=\"img_id3153345\" src=\"sfx2/res/indexon_small.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153345\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
