helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082C				0	he	Right-click the "Internet Link" or "Visited Internet Link" character style, and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
