helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\flat_icons.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	he	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	הוספת רווחים מוגנים, מקפים ותווי-הפרדה מותנים				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155364				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>protected spaces;inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spaces; inserting protected spaces\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hyphens;inserting custom\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>conditional separators\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>separators; conditional\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>dashes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>non-breaking dashes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>replacing;dashes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>protected dashes\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155364				0	he	\<variable id=\"space_hyphen\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/space_hyphen.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Protected Spaces, Hyphens and Conditional Separators\"\>הוספת רווחים מוגנים, מקפים ותווי-הפרדה מותנים\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136				0	he	רווחים בלתי-שבירים				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	31			0	he	כדי למנוע מצירוף של שתי מילים להישבר בסוף שורה, יש ללחוץ \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift בזמן כתיבת הרווח בין שתי המילים.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id5749687				0	he	לא ניתן להוסיף רווחים בלתי-שבירים ב-Calc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146957				0	he	מקף בלתי-שביר				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3148538				0	he	כדי להוסיף מקף בלתי-שביר יש ללחוץ Shift+Ctrl ומקש מינוס. כדוגמא לשימוש לשימוש במקף בלתי-שביר, נניח שברצונך לכתוב שם של חברה בשם א-ב. בדוגמא זו לא נרצה ששם החברה יישבר בסוף השורה והאות ב' תופיע בשורה הבאה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163802				0	he	קו מפריד				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749	66			0	he	כדי להוסיף קו מפריד שנראה כמו מקף רחב יותר , אפשר למצוא את האפשרות \<emph\>החלף מקפים\</emph\> תחת \<emph\>כלים - אפשרויות תיקון אוטומטי \</emph\>\<emph\>- אפשרויות\</emph\>. אפשרות זו מחליפה במקרים מסויימים מקף, או שני מקפים רצופים, בקו מפריד או קו מפריד ארוך (ר' \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040100.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Help\"\>עזרה של ‎$[officename] ‎\</link\>).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561	67			0	he	לחילופי טקסט נוספים אפשר לעיין בטבלת ההחלפות שמופיעה ב-\<emph\>כלים - אפשרויות תיקון אוטומטי\</emph\>\<emph\>- \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"Replace\"\>\<emph\>החלף\</emph\>\</link\>. שם אפשר, בין היתר, להחליף קיצור-דרך באופן אוטומטי לקו מפריד, גם בשפה אחרת.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153825				0	he	תו-מפריד קובע				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154306	60			0	he	כהשלמה למיקוף אוטומטי, באפשרותך להוסיף תו-מפריד באמצע מילה, בעזרת המקשים \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+סימן מינוס. המילה תישבר במיקום זה כשתופיע בסוף שורה, גם אם האפשרות למיקוף אוטומטי כבוי בפיסקה זו.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\space_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/04100000.xhp\" name=\"Special characters\"\>תווים מיוחדים\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Accepting or Rejecting Changes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150247				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>changes; accepting or rejecting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>review function;accepting or rejecting changes\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150247				0	he	\<variable id=\"redlining_accept\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/redlining_accept.xhp\" name=\"Accepting or Rejecting Changes\"\>Accepting or Rejecting Changes\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id1491134				0	he	The review function is available in %PRODUCTNAME for text documents and spreadsheet documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id1110200810120034				0	he	In Writer text documents you can also accept or reject changes by choosing commands from the context menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	he	When you edit a document in which others have made changes, you can accept or reject the changes individually or all together.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008				0	he	If you have put multiple copies of the document in circulation, first merge these into one document (see \<embedvar href=\"text/shared/guide/redlining_docmerge.xhp#redlining_docmerge\"/\>).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	he	Open the document and choose \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Accept or Reject\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Accept or Reject Changes\</emph\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	he	Select a change on the \<emph\>List\</emph\> tab. The change is selected and displayed in the document and you can now enter your decision with one of the buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	he	If one author has modified another author's change, you will see the changes hierarchically arranged with a plus sign for opening up the hierarchy.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id3148474				0	he	If the list of changes is too long, you can switch to the \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> tab in the dialog and specify that you only want to see the changes of certain authors, or only the changes of the last day, or that you want the list to be restricted in some other way.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_accept.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	he	Color-coded entries display the result of the filter that is set. Entries in black can be accepted or rejected and match the filter criteria. Entries in blue do not themselves match the filter criteria, but have subentries that are included by the filter. Gray entries cannot be accepted or rejected and do not match the filter criterion. Green entries do match the filter but cannot be accepted or rejected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Navigator for Document Overview				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147008				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>documents; contents as lists\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Navigator; contents as lists\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147008				0	he	\<variable id=\"navigator\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/navigator.xhp\" name=\"Navigator for Document Overview\"\>Navigator for Document Overview\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	he	All contents of the Navigator window are referred to here as "categories," whether titles, sheets, tables, text frames, graphics, OLE objects, sections, hyperlinks, references, indexes or notes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	he	The Navigator displays all types of objects contained in a document. If a plus sign appears next to a category, this indicates that at least one object of this kind exists. If you rest the mouse pointer on the category name, the number of objects is displayed in an extended tip.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	he	Open a category by clicking on the plus sign. If you only want to view the entries in a certain category, select the category and click the \<emph\>Content View\</emph\> icon. Until you click the icon again, only the objects of this category will be displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3166461				0	he	You may dock the Navigator to any document border or turn it back into a free window (double click on the gray area). You can change the size of the Navigator when it is a free window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Saving Documents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147226				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>documents; saving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>saving; documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>backups; documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>files; saving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text; saving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; saving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>drawings; saving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations; saving\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>FTP; saving documents\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	he	\<variable id=\"doc_save\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/doc_save.xhp\" name=\"Saving Documents\"\>Saving Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	he	Click the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon or press the shortcut keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+S.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3155450				0	he	\<image id=\"img_id3152349\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_save.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152349\"\>This icon is for tips on how to use the program more effectively.\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	he	The document is saved under its path and name on the current local data medium or network drive or on the Internet, overwriting any file of the same name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	he	When you save a new file for the first time, the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01070000.xhp\" name=\"Save As\"\>Save As\</link\> dialog opens, in which you can enter a name, folder and drive or volume for the file. To open this dialog, choose \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472				0	he	You can set the automatic creation of a backup copy under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010200.xhp\" name=\"Load/Save - General\"\>Load/Save - General\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	hd_id7146824				0	he	Automatic extension to the file name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id9359111				0	he	When saving a file, %PRODUCTNAME always appends an extension to the file name, except when the file name already has an extension that matches the file type. See the list of \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000021.xhp\"\>ODF extensions\</link\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id6709494				0	he	Some examples for the automatic extensions are listed in the following table:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id9009674				0	he	You enter this file name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id485549				0	he	You select this file type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3987243				0	he	File is saved with this name				20200411 15:09:53
