helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	he	On the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100500.xhp\" name=\"last dialog page of the Report AutoPilot\"\>last dialog page of the Report Wizard\</link\>, you can choose to edit the report template before you use the report.				20200411 15:09:53
