helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	he	Select any combination of the four options, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EF				0	he	All documents that you print from now on will use the changed options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F3				0	he	Print your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_faster.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	he	You can reduce data for transparency, for gradients, or for bitmaps. When you reduce the data, on many printers you will not see a reduction of printing quality. But the printing time is substantially shorter, and when you print to a file, the file size is much smaller.				20200411 15:09:53
