helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10ACD				0	he	The XML Filter Settings dialog is only available when a text document is open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10ACA				0	he	In Writer, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AD9				0	he	Select the filter that you want to distribute and click \<emph\>Save As Package\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AE0				0	he	To install an XML filter from a package				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AEA				0	he	The XML Filter Settings dialog is only available when a text document is opened.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AE7				0	he	In Writer, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AF6				0	he	Click \<emph\>Open Package\</emph\> and select the package file with the filter you want to install.				20200411 15:09:53
