helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0A				0	he	In Writer, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_distribute.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B19				0	he	Select the filter you want to delete and click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
