helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Index - Keyword Search in the Help				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149428				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>Index tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; keywords\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	he	\<variable id=\"00000130\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index - Keyword Search in the Help\"\>Index - Keyword Search in the Help\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3150960				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_INDEX_CB_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Double-click an entry or type the word you want to find in the index.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3148668				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_INDEX_PB_OPEN_INDEX\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to display the selected topic.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	he	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	he	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	he	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Getting Support				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143272				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>תמיכה דרך האינטרנט\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>תמיכה\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>קבוצות-דיון ותמיכה\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>תמיכה באינטרנט\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146873				0	he	\<variable id=\"00000001\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000001.xhp\" name=\"Getting Support\"\>תמיכה\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id9173253				0	he	רבות מהשאלות והתשובות עבור ‎%PRODUCTNAME‎ זהות לאלו שנשאלות ונענות עבור חבילות תוכנה משרדיות מסחריות.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150667				0	he	You can find support on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	he	For a summary of the current support services refer to the \<emph\>Readme\</emph\> file in the \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> folder.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id26327				0	he	תמיכה בשפה שלך				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id1318380				0	he	The %PRODUCTNAME localization projects offer support pages in local languages. Find an overview of the native language projects at \<link href=\"https://projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\"\>projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\</link\>. You can find help and support in English language on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2611386				0	he	רשימות-דיוור				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166335				0	he	Ask about %PRODUCTNAME, find help by volunteers, and discuss topics on the public mailing lists. You can find many general and specialized mailing lists on the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\"\>www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0915200811081722				0	he	קבוצת-דיון				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200811081778				0	he	אפשר להשתתף בקבוצות-דיון כדי לשאול שאלות ולקבל תשובות בקשר ל-‎‎%PRODUCTNAME‎.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0804200803314150				0	he	אבטחה				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803314235				0	he	In case you are concerned about any security issue with using this software, please refer to the \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/security/index.html\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Security\</link\> page on our website.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168534				0	he	Downloads				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3028143				0	he	You can download the latest version of %PRODUCTNAME at \<link href=\"https://download.openoffice.org/\"\>download.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2602967				0	he	Documentation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3497211				0	he	You can download documentation as PDF files, how-tos, and guides from the %PRODUCTNAME website at \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org\"\>documentation.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0120200910361765				0	he	Participate and give back				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361848				0	he	If you want to take an active role in the worldwide %PRODUCTNAME community, you are very welcome to give feedback, discuss features, propose enhancements, write your own article in an FAQ, how-to, manual, create a video tutorial, etc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361874				0	he	Visit the \<link href=\"https://documentation.openoffice.org/\"\>documentation web site\</link\> or the \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation\"\>Wiki starting page\</link\> and follow the links for contributors.				20200411 15:09:53
