helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	he	Double-click an open folder to close it and hide the subfolders and Help pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	he	\<image id=\"img_id3150255\" src=\"sfx2/res/hlpdoc.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150255\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3152909				0	he	Double-click a document icon to display the corresponding Help page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000160.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	he	Use the arrow keys in combination with the Return key to drop down and roll up entries and to open documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Icons in the Documentation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Icons in the Documentation\"\>סמלים בתיעוד\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	he	Icons in the Documentation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	he	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	he	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	he	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	he	סמל ה"עצה" מציין עצות לעבודה יעילה יותר עם התוכנה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150672				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>Help; Help tips\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tooltips; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Help Agent; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Clippy, see Help Agent\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155599				0	he	\<variable id=\"00000120\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000120.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\"\>Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	2			0	he	The Help Agent, Tips, and Extended Tips provide help while you work. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	he	The Help Agent				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	he	The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Help Agent\</link\> starts automatically when you are performing a task that might require some assistance. The Help Agent appears in a small window in a corner of the document. To view the help for the task, click inside the Help Agent window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	he	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task. To disable the Help Agent choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	he	Tips				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896				0	he	Tips provide you with the names of toolbar buttons. To display a tip, rest the pointer over a toolbar button until the name of the button appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	he	Tips are also displayed for some elements in a document, such as chapter names when you scroll through a long document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	he	Enable or disable the tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	he	Extended Tips				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	he	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	he	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window				20200411 15:09:53
