helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	he	Use the \<emph\>Add to Bookmarks\</emph\> icon to set a bookmark for the current page shown in the Help.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	he	You can find the bookmarks on the \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	he	Use the Del key to delete a selected bookmark.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	he	The following commands are on the context menu of a bookmark:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	he	\<emph\>Display\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_OPEN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>displays the selected help subject\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	he	\<emph\>Rename\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>opens a dialog for entering another name for the bookmark\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	he	\<emph\>Delete\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_DELETE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>deletes the bookmark selected \</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
