helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	he	All your settings will be automatically saved. To open an entry either double click this entry or click the plus sign. To collapse the entry, click the minus sign or double click the entry.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10607				0	he	You will only see the entries that are applicable to the current document. If the current document is a text document, you will see the %PRODUCTNAME Writer entry, and so on for all modules of %PRODUCTNAME. %PRODUCTNAME Impress and %PRODUCTNAME Draw are treated as the same in this dialog. The common entries are always visible.				20200411 15:09:53
