helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_LINGU\"\>Specifies the properties of the spellcheck, thesaurus and hyphenation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149096				0	he	Available Language Modules				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CLB_LINGU_MODULES\"\>Contains the installed language modules.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153663	35			0	he	A language module can contain one, two or three submodules: Spellcheck, hyphenation and thesaurus. Each sub-module can be available in one or more languages. If you click in front of the name of the module, you activate all the available sub-modules simultaneously. If you remove a set mark, you deactivate all the available sub-modules simultaneously. If you wish to activate or deactivate individual sub-modules, click the\<emph\> Edit button \</emph\>to open the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010401.xhp\" name=\"Edit Modules\"\>\<emph\>Edit Modules\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3294778				0	he	The configuration allows for two different directories: one folder where the user has write permissions, and one without write permissions. The user can only edit and delete the user dictionaries that are located in the writable path. Other dictionaries can be read only.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154307				0	he	Edit				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673	37			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SFXPAGE_LINGU_PB_LINGU_MODULES_EDIT\"\>To edit a language module, select it and click \<emph\>Edit\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010401.xhp\" name=\"Edit Modules\"\>\<emph\>Edit \</emph\>\<emph\>Modules\</emph\>\</link\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153348				0	he	User-defined dictionaries				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CLB_EDIT_MODULES_DICS\"\>Lists the available user dictionaries.\</ahelp\> Mark the user dictionaries that you want to use for spellcheck and hyphenation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144511				0	he	New				20200411 15:09:53
