helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:NUMERICFIELD:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:ED_STEPS\"\>Sets the maximum number of iteration steps.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
