helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153139				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:ED_EPS\"\>Specifies the difference between two consecutive iteration step results. If the result of the iteration is lower than the minimum change value, then the iteration will stop.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
