helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	he	You can also change the basic fonts for Asian and complex text layout languages if their support is enabled in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
