helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	he	Defines the typographic default settings for Asian text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143268				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>kerning;Asian texts\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143268				0	he	Kerning				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	he	Defines the default settings for kerning between individual characters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147275				0	he	Western characters only				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_CHAR_KERNING\"\>Specifies that kerning is only applied to western text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	he	Western text and Asian punctuation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_CHAR_PUNCT\"\>Specifies that kerning is applied to both western text and Asian punctuation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153088				0	he	Character spacing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	he	Defines the default settings for character spacing in Asian texts, cells, and drawing objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150669				0	he	No compression				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_NO_COMP\"\>Specifies that no compression at all will occur.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	he	Compress only punctuation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_PUNCT_COMP\"\>Specifies that only the punctuation is compressed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151245				0	he	Compress punctuation and Japanese Kana				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_PUNCT_KANA_COMP\"\>Specifies that punctuation and Japanese Kana are compressed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148552				0	he	First and last characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	he	Defines the default settings for 'first' and 'last' characters. In the dialog that appears when you choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020700.xhp\" name=\"Asian Typography\"\>\<emph\>Asian Typography\</emph\>\</link\>, you can specify whether the list of forbidden characters applies to those at the beginning or end of a line in a paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154071				0	he	Language				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_LB_LANGUAGE\"\>Specifies the language for which you want to define first and last characters.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145606				0	he	Default				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148920	22			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_CB_STANDARD\"\>When you mark\<emph\> Default\</emph\>, the following two text boxes are filled with the default characters for the selected language:\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144761				0	he	Not at start of line:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156214				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_START\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the beginning of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the beginning of a line after a line break, it is automatically moved to the end of the previous line. For example, an exclamation point at the end of a sentence never appears at the start of a line if it is part of the \<emph\>Not at start of line\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154908				0	he	Not at end of line:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	26			0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_END\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the end of a line due to a line break, it is automatically moved to the beginning of the next line. For example, a currency symbol that appears in front of an amount never appears at the end of a line if it is part of the\<emph\> Not at end of line\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	User Data				20200411 15:09:53
