helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149560				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_AUTOSAVE\"\>Specifies that \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> saves the information needed to restore all open documents in case of a crash. You can specify the saving time interval.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
