helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3158410				0	he	Allows you to edit, add, or delete records from the database table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152463				0	he	Cutting, copying and pasting data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	he	You can cut, copy, and paste table fields in \<emph\>Data Source\</emph\> view. The Data Source browser also supports the dragging and dropping of table fields, or simple text and numbers from other $[officename] files.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3146921				0	he	You cannot drag and drop to Yes/No, binary, image, or counting table fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064				0	he	Drag and drop only works in \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> mode.				20200411 15:09:53
