helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10646				0	he	Some filters are only available as optional components during the %PRODUCTNAME installation. To install an optional filter, run the %PRODUCTNAME Setup application, select "Modify", and then select the filter that you want in the list of modules.				20200411 15:09:53
