helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156553				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FORMAT_FOOTER\"\>Adds a footer to the current page style. A footer is an area in the bottom page margin, where you can add text or graphics.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
