helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	he	If the fields in your database are read-only, ensure that the data source view is closed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506				0	he	The supplied bibliography database contains sample records of books.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155356				0	he	Use the toolbar to select a table in the bibliography database, to search for records, or to sort the records using filters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available tables in the current database. Click a name in the list to display the records for that table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158432				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Go to the first record in the table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149192				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Go to the previous record in the table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
