helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id1906491				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Checks for available updates to your version of %PRODUCTNAME. If a newer version is available, you can choose to download the update. After downloading, if you have write permissions for the installation directory, you can install the update.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id4799340				0	he	Once the download starts, you see a progress bar and three buttons on the dialog. You can pause and resume the download by clicking the Pause and Resume buttons. Click Cancel to abort the download and delete the partly downloaded file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id1502121				0	he	By default, downloads will be stored to your desktop. You can change the folder where the downloaded file will be stored in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Online Update.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id8266853				0	he	After the download is complete, you can click Install to start the installation of the update. You see a confirmation dialog, where you can choose to close %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id2871181				0	he	Under some operation systems, it may be required to manually go to the download folder, unzip the download file, and start the setup script.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id2733542				0	he	After installation of the update you can delete the download file to save space.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id4238715				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Downloads and saves the update files to the desktop or a folder of your choice. Select the folder in %PRODUCTNAME - Online Update in the Options dialog box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id8277230				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Installs the downloaded update.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
