helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150144				0	he	Correct TWo INitial CApitals				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	he	If you type two uppercase letters at the beginning of a "WOrd", the second uppercase letter is automatically replaced with a lowercase letter.				20200411 15:09:53
