helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155339				0	he	Capitalizes the first letter of every sentence.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id5240028				0	he	The first letter in a Calc cell will never be capitalized automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	he	Automatic *bold* and _underline_				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	he	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underline to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	he	This feature does not work if the formatting characters * or _ are entered with an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#IME\" name=\"Input Method Editor\"\>Input Method Editor\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
