helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	he	To create a new macro, select the "Standard" module in the \<emph\>Macro from\</emph\> list, and then click \<emph\>New\</emph\>. You can also create a new module, select it in the \<emph\>Macro from \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
