helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	hd_id31499F				0	he	The password to edit the current document can be set in the Properties dialog on the Security tab page. Currently this option is evaluated for documents in some Microsoft file formats.				20200411 15:09:53
