helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	he	To change the default template path, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010300.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Paths\"\>$[officename] - Paths\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
