helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155504				0	he	To copy a style, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>and drag the style from one file to another file. To move a style, drag the style from one file to another file.				20200411 15:09:53
