helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148620				0	he	If you have made changes to the current document, you are prompted if you want to \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01060000.xhp\" name=\"save\"\>save\</link\> your changes.				20200411 15:09:53
