helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\07010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158442				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NewWindow\"\>Opens a new window that displays the contents of the current window.\</ahelp\> You can now view different parts of the same document at the same time.				20200411 15:09:53
