helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06150110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149549				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_XML_FILTER_INTERFACE_NAME\"\>Enter the name that you want to display in the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box in file dialogs.\</ahelp\> You must enter a unique name. For import filters, the name appears in the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> box of \<emph\>Open\</emph\> dialogs. For export filters, the name appears in the \<emph\>File format\</emph\> box of \<emph\>Export\</emph\> dialogs.				20200411 15:09:53
