helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149798				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the sentence with the misspelled word highlighted. Edit the word or the sentence, or click one of the suggestions in the text box below.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
