helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155994				0	he	Ignore Once				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148920				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_SPELLCHECK:BTN_IGNORE\"\>Skips the unknown word and continues with the spellcheck.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CB				0	he	This label of this button changes to \<emph\>Resume\</emph\> if you leave the Spellcheck dialog open when you return to your document. To continue the spellcheck from the current position of the cursor, click \<emph\>Resume\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1024200804091149				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>While performing a grammar check, click Ignore Rule to ignore the rule that is currently flagged as a grammar error.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150740				0	he	Ignore All				20200411 15:09:53
