helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154186				0	he	Each object that you place in your document is successively stacked on the preceding object. Use the arrange commands to change the stacking order of objects in your document. You cannot change the stacking order of text.				20200411 15:09:53
