helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\formatting_mark.xhp	0	help	par_id1536301				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts an invisible space within a word that will insert a line break once it becomes the last character in a line. Available when complex text layout (CTL) is enabled.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\formatting_mark.xhp	0	help	hd_id3245643				0	he	No-width no break				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\formatting_mark.xhp	0	help	par_id1085238				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts an invisible space within a word that will keep the word together at the end of a line. Available when complex text layout (CTL) is enabled.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
