helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"FILTER_EDIT_RID_PDF_EXPORT_DLG_ED_PAGES\"\>Exports the pages you type in the box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	he	To export a range of pages, use the format 3-6. To export single pages, use the format 7;9;11. If you want, you can export a combination of page ranges and single pages, by using a format like 3-6;8;10;12.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147043				0	he	Selection				20200411 15:09:53
