helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id7928708				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable this checkbox to convert the URLs referencing other ODF files to PDF files with the same name. In the referencing URLs the extensions .odt, .odp, .ods, .odg, and .odm are converted to the extension .pdf.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
