helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	he	The following capitalization effects are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	he	Without - no effect is applied				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154280				0	he	Capitals - changes the selected lowercase characters to uppercase characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148947				0	he	Lowercase - changes the selected uppercase characters to lower characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	he	Title font - changes the first character of each selected word to an uppercase character				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154937				0	he	Small capitals - changes the selected lowercase characters to uppercase characters, and then reduces their size				20200411 15:09:53
