helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\tablewizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055D				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to create a primary key. Add a primary key to every database table to uniquely identify each record. For some database systems within %PRODUCTNAME, a primary key is mandatory for editing the tables.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
