helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\tablewizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10579				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to automatically insert a value and increment the field's value for each new record. The database must support automatic incrementation in order to use the \<emph\>Auto value\</emph\> feature.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
