helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menutools.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670				0	he	Select the tables that you want to filter in the \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menutools.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985				0	he	If you select the topmost table in a hierarchy, all of the tables in the hierarchy are selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\menutools.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	he	If you select a table that is at a lower level in the hierarchy, the tables that occur above it in the hierarchy are not selected.				20200411 15:09:53
