helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7175817				0	he	On first start of the Report Builder, the Properties window shows the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page for the whole report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id9895931				0	he	Select a table from the Contents list, then press Tab or click outside the input box to leave the input box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3587145				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Add Field window is shown automatically when you have selected a table in the Contents box and leave that box. You can also click the Add Field icon on the toolbar, or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Add Field\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6993926				0	he	The \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page can be used to change the name of the report, and to disable the Page Header or Page Footer areas, among others.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3729361				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To display the Data or General tab page for the whole report, choose Edit - Select Report.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1768852				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Groups are kept together by page or by column (default). You must enable Keep Together also.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
