helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id401623				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies in which context the page footer will be printed: on all pages, or not on pages with a report header or footer\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
