helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7022003				0	he	If you click the Page Header or Page Footer area without selecting any object, you see the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page for that area.				20200411 15:09:53
