helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropcon.xhp	0	help	par_idN10551				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Changes the type of connection for the current database.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropcon.xhp	0	help	par_id9003875				0	he	In a database window, choose \<emph\>Edit - Database - Connection Type\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropcon.xhp	0	help	par_idN10569				0	he	The Connection Type Wizard consists of three pages. You cannot transfer all settings from one database type to another.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropcon.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	he	For example, you can use the wizard to open a database file that is in a format that is usually not recognized by an installed database.				20200411 15:09:53
