helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10556				0	he	Specifies the conditions to group the query. The data source must support the SQL statement "Order by clauses" to enable this page of the Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10559				0	he	Match all of the following				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard06.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055D				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to group the query by all the conditions using a logical AND.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10560				0	he	Match any of the following				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10564				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select to group the query by any of the conditions using a logical OR.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
