helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829				0	he	Use this dialog to define the user settings for an Adabas table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147143				0	he	User Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	he	Allows you to select the user, define a new user, delete a user, and change a password.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136				0	he	User				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the user, whose settings you want to edit.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147576				0	he	New user				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a new user.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05000003.xhp\" name=\"Enter Password\"\>Enter Password\</link\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149182				0	he	Change password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Changes the password for the selected user.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05000003.xhp\" name=\"Change Password\"\>Change Password\</link\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149398				0	he	Delete user				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Deletes the selected user.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156152				0	he	Access rights for user selected				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	he	Allows you to view and assign access rights for the selected user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Enter / change password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163829				0	he	Enter / change password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	he	Allows you to enter and confirm a new or changed password. If you have defined a new user, enter the user's name in this dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157898				0	he	User				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:EDIT:DLG_PASSWD:ED_PASSWD_USER\"\>Specifies the name of the new user.\</ahelp\> This field is only visible if you have defined a new user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153681				0	he	Old password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_EDIT_DLG_PASSWORD_ED_OLDPASSWORD\"\>Enter the old password.\</ahelp\> This field is visible when you have started the dialog via \<emph\>Change password\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153311				0	he	Password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_EDIT_DLG_PASSWORD_ED_PASSWORD\"\>Enter the new password.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147275				0	he	Confirm (password)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_EDIT_DLG_PASSWORD_ED_PASSWORD_REPEAT\"\>Enter the new password again.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Adabas D Database				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151262				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30000000.xhp\" name=\"Adabas D Database\"\>Adabas D Database\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3479720				0	he	The Adabas D software package can be downloaded and installed separately (see www.adabas.com).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152997				0	he	About Adabas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	he	The free available Adabas database is restricted to a size of 100 MB, and a maximum of three users on a network. See the "License.txt" file in the Adabas directory for more details. The Adabas database must be installed in a separate directory from $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	he	The name of an Adabas file cannot exceed 8 characters. The path to the Adabas file, including the file name, cannot exceed 30 characters, and must be compliant with the 7-bit ASCII code. Both the path and the file name cannot contain spaces.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153254				0	he	Under Windows, the Adabas setup application adds the DBROOT environment variable that contains the path information for the database. If the setup application finds this variable, it does not install the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	he	Create New Adabas Database				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149378				0	he	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30100000.xhp\" name=\"Create New Adabas Database\"\>\<emph\>Create New Adabas Database\</emph\>\</link\> dialog to create an Adabas database:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147045				0	he	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Database\</emph\> to open the Database Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	he	Click \<emph\>Connect to an existing database\</emph\>, and then select "Adabas" in the listbox (scroll up in the listbox).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155600				0	he	Follow the remaining pages of the Database Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154270				0	he	Deleting an Adabas Database				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157869				0	he	To delete the reference to an Adabas database, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Base - Databases\</emph\>. Select the database, and then click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
