helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_TABLEDESIGN_INSERTROWS\"\>Inserts an empty row above the current row, if the table has not been saved. Inserts an empty row at the end of the table if the table has been saved.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153524				0	he	Primary Key				20200411 15:09:53
