helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150575				0	he	New line				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150587				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_NEWLINE\"\>Inserts a new line in your document.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>newline\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
