helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_CSUBX\"\>Inserts a subscript directly under a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?>csub<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
