helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154592				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ALIGNLX\"\>This icon assigns left-alignment to "a" and inserts a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can type \<emph\>alignl<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
