helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154723				0	he	Align to horizontal center				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149319				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ALIGNCX\"\>Assigns horizontal central alignment to "a" and inserts a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>alignc<?>\</emph\> directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_idN10352				0	he	\<image id=\"img_id3155583\" src=\"starmath/res/co21911.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155583\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149768				0	he	Align right				20200411 15:09:53
