helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Automatically updates a modified formula. If you do not select this option, the formula will only be updated after you choose \<emph\>View - Update\</emph\> or press F9.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
