helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155074				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_PHANTOMX\"\>Inserts a placeholder for a transparent character. This character takes up the space of "a" but does not display it.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>phantom <?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
