helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	bm_id7621997				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>donut charts\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>pie charts;types\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>chart types;pie/donut\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	hd_id3365276				0	he	\<variable id=\"type_pie\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_pie.xhp\"\>Chart Type Pie\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id245979				0	he	On the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose a chart type. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	hd_id5799432				0	he	Pie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id6549272				0	he	A pie chart shows values as circular sectors of the total circle. The length of the arc, or the area of each sector, is proportional to its value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id6529740				0	he	Pie - this subtype shows sectors as colored areas of the total pie, for one data column only. In the created chart, you can click and drag any sector to separate that sector from the remaining pie or to join it back.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id9121982				0	he	Exploded pie - this subtype shows the sectors already separated from each other. In the created chart, you can click and drag any sector to move it along a radial from the pie's center.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id3808404				0	he	Donut - this subtype can show multiple data columns. Each data column is shown as one donut shape with a hole inside, where the next data column can be shown. In the created chart, you can click and drag an outer sector to move it along a radial from the donut's center.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id2394482				0	he	Exploded donut - this subtype shows the outer sectors already separated from the remaining donut. In the created chart, you can click and drag an outer sector to move it along a radial from the donut's center.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Grid				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150398				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>X axes;grid formatting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Y axes;grid formatting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Z axes; grid formatting\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398				0	he	Grid				20200411 15:09:53
