helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id5154576				0	he	Standard Error: Displays the standard error.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157979				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Variance: Displays the variance calculated from the number of data points and respective values.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153249				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Standard Deviation: Displays the standard deviation (square root of the variance).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149870				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Error Margin: Displays the highest error margin in percent according to the highest value of the data group. Set the percentage in the Parameters area.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id350962				0	he	Cell Range				20200411 15:09:53
