helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0428200810573977				0	he	Same value for both				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0428200810573991				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable to use the positive error values also as negative error values. You can only change the value of the "Positve (+)" box. That value gets copied to the "Negative (-)" box automatically.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
