helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149048				0	he	Major:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150397				0	he	Specifies whether the marks are to be on the inner or outer side of the axis. It is possible to combine both: you will then see marks on both sides.				20200411 15:09:53
