helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id2129276				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a sub type of the basic chart type.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
