helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155263				0	he	In 3D Rotation Object				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145169				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertInto3DLathe\"\>Converts the selected 2D object(s) to a 3D object, by rotating the object(s) around a symmetry line.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332	36			0	he	Drag the symmetry line to a new location to change the shape of the converted object. To change the orientation of the symmetry line, drag one of its end points. Click the object to convert it to 3D. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150928				0	he	\<image id=\"img_id3145295\" src=\"svx/res/rotate3d.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145295\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
