helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	he	To create a flowchart:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	he	Select a tool from the \<emph\>Flowchart\</emph\> toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	he	Drag a shape in your slide.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	he	To add more shapes, repeat the last steps.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146967	43			0	he	Open the \<emph\>Connectors \</emph\>toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and select a connector line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3149945				0	he	Move the pointer over the edge of a shape so that the connection sites appear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146871				0	he	Click a connection site, drag to a connection site on another shape, and then release.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145824				0	he	To add more connectors, repeat the last steps.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3153036				0	he	You now have the basic outline for your flowchart.				20200411 15:09:53
