helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154510				0	he	\<variable id=\"palette_files\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/palette_files.xhp\" name=\"Loading Color, Gradient, and Hatching Lists\"\>Loading Color, Gradient, and Hatching Lists\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385	73			0	he	You can use lists to organize colors, gradients, or hatching patterns. $[officename] provides several lists that you can load and use in your document. If you want, you can add or delete elements from a list, or even create custom lists. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155961				0	he	To load a color list:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	he	Choose \<emph\>Format - Area\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Colors\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	he	Click the \<emph\>Load Color List\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3151239				0	he	Locate the color list that you want to load, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>. A color list file has the format [filename].soc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3154762				0	he	To save a color list, click the \<emph\>Save Color List\</emph\> button, enter a filename, and then click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149871				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>colors; default colors\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3149871				0	he	The CMYK list is optimized for print colors, whereas the colors in the Web and the HTML lists are optimized for displays using a resolution of 256 colors.				20200411 15:09:53
