helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Creating a Custom Slide Show				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146119				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>slide shows; custom\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>custom slide shows\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>starting; always with the current slide\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>starting;custom slide shows\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding;slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>showing;hidden slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hidden pages;showing\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119				0	he	\<variable id=\"individual\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/individual.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Custom Slide Show\"\>Creating a Custom Slide Show\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150344				0	he	You can create custom slide shows to meet the needs of your audience using slides within the current presentation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150715				0	he	To create a custom slide show:				20200411 15:09:53
