helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153966	62			0	he	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\> and enter a name for your slide show in the \<emph\>Name \</emph\>box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249				0	he	Under \<emph\>Existing Slides\</emph\>, select the slides you want to add to your slide show, and click the \<emph\>>>\</emph\> button. Hold down Shift to select a range of slides, or Ctrl to select multiple slides.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916				0	he	You can change the order of the slides in your custom slide show, by dragging and dropping the slides under \<emph\>Selected Slides\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
