helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241				0	he	Select a 2D object on the slide or page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3148774				0	he	Right-click the object and choose \<emph\>Convert - To Polygon.\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3155368				0	he	To modify the shape of the object, click the \<emph\>Points\</emph\> icon\<image id=\"img_id7219458\" src=\"svx/res/cd015.png\" width=\"0.2201inch\" height=\"0.2201inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7219458\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> toolbar, and drag the handles of the object.				20200411 15:09:53
