helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3148828				0	he	To edit the properties of the 3D object, use the \<emph\>Line and Filling\</emph\> toolbar and the \<emph\>3D Settings\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
