helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149377				0	he	\<variable id=\"line_draw\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/line_draw.xhp\" name=\"Drawing Curves\"\>Drawing Curves\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3148868	4			0	he	The \<emph\>Curve\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3150205\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_linetoolbox.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150205\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> toolbar opens a toolbar to draw Bézier curves. Bézier curves are defined by a start point and an end point, which are called "anchors". The curvature of the Bézier curve is defined by control points ("handles"). Moving a control point changes the shape of the Bézier curve.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id8532364				0	he	Control points are only visible in "Edit Points" mode. Control points are represented by circles, anchor points are represented by squares. The start point is a little bit larger than the other anchor points.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3150210				0	he	Bézier curve segments and straight line segments can be joined to form more complex Bézier curves. Three different transitions can be applied to join adjacent segments:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3154766				0	he	A \<emph\>symmetrical\</emph\> anchor point has the same line curvature on either side, and two control lines that move together as a straight line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874				0	he	A \<emph\>smooth\</emph\> anchor point may have different line curvatures on either side.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	par_id3150435				0	he	A \<emph\>corner\</emph\> anchor point has one or two independent control lines. Changing one side has no effect on the other side.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	hd_id46388				0	he	How to use the Curve tool				20200411 15:09:53
