helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3150743	62			0	he	Select a curved line, and then click the \<emph\>Points \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> Bar.				20200411 15:09:53
