helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145162				0	he	To convert a data point on a curved line:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3150336	64			0	he	Select a curved line, and then click the \<emph\>Points \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> Bar.				20200411 15:09:53
