helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	he	In \<emph\>Normal View\</emph\>, choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Page\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3148871	6			0	he	In \<emph\>Layout settings \</emph\>area, select the \<emph\>Fit object to paper format\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	he	In the \<emph\>Paper format\</emph\> area, select a \<emph\>Format\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\print_tofit.xhp	0	help	par_id3150431				0	he	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The slide is resized to fit the printed page, while maintaining the relative positions of the objects on the slide.				20200411 15:09:53
