helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017				0	he	You can use styles to organize similar line and arrow types. $[officename] provides a few standard style files that you can load and use in your document. If you want, you can add or delete elements from a style file, or even create a custom style file.				20200411 15:09:53
