helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	he	Locate the file containing the line styles that you want to load, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The file has the format [filename].sod.				20200411 15:09:53
