helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148430				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:CHECKBOX:DLG_START_PRESENTATION:CBX_NAVIGATOR\"\>Displays the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\> during the slide show.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
