helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157978				0	he	To set the snap range, choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070300.xhp\" name=\"Drawing - Grid\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Draw - Grid\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070300.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - Grid\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - Grid\</emph\>\</link\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> in the Options dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
