helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B00				0	he	Adds the previous sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the sheets in a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only selects the previous sheet. Makes the previous sheet the current sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B03				0	he	Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Down				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B07				0	he	Adds the next sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the sheets in a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only selects the next sheet. Makes the next sheet the current sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145826				0	he	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + *				20200411 15:09:53
