helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	he	Formatting Tables and Cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154022				0	he	Entering Values and Formulas				20200411 15:09:53
