helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159094				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>ROT13 function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>encrypting text\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
