helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3146781				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_ROT13\"\>Encrypts a character string by moving the characters 13 positions in the alphabet.\</ahelp\> After the letter Z, the alphabet begins again (Rotation). By applying the encryption function again to the resulting code, you can decrypt the text.				20200411 15:09:53
