helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153249				0	he	Text: Enter the character string to be encrypted. ROT13(ROT13(Text)) decrypts the code.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151300				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>DAYSINYEAR function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>number of days; in a specific year\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
