helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	he	DAYSINYEAR(Date)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153803				0	he	Date: Any date in the respective year. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153487				0	he	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153811				0	he	DAYSINYEAR(A1) returns 366 days if A1 contains 2/29/68, a valid date for the year 1968.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154737				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>DAYSINMONTH function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>number of days;in a specific month of a year\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
