helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	par_id3149747				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_STUNDE\"\>Returns the hour for a given time value.\</ahelp\> The hour is returned as an integer between 0 and 23.				20200411 15:09:53
