helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	par_id3159215				0	he	HOUR(NOW()) returns the current hour				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	par_id3145152				0	he	HOUR(C4) returns 17 if the contents of C4 = 17:20:00.				20200411 15:09:53
