helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	he	To show a column or row, select the range of rows or columns containing the hidden elements, then choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Show\</emph\> or \<emph\>Format - Column - Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	he	To show all hidden cells, first click in the field in the upper left corner. This selects all cells of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
