helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154047				0	he	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is or refers to the value to be tested. ISERROR() returns TRUE if there is an error and FALSE if not.				20200411 15:09:53
