helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148918				0	he	ISLOGICAL(value)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946				0	he	Returns TRUE if \<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a logical value (TRUE or FALSE), and returns FALSE otherwise.				20200411 15:09:53
