helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3149453				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_ERFC\"\>Returns complementary values of the Gaussian error integral between x and infinity.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
