helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3151170				0	he	HEX2OCT(Number;Places)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3152795				0	he	Number: the hexadecimal number. The number can have a maximum of 10 places. The most significant bit is the sign bit, the following bits return the value. Negative numbers are entered as two's complement.				20200411 15:09:53
