helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150871				0	he	Data field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	he	The contents of this dialog is different for data fields in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> area, and data fields in the \<emph\>Row\</emph\> or \<emph\>Column\</emph\> area of the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090102.xhp\" name=\"Pivot table\"\>Pivot Table\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
