helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3149973				0	he	In which week number does 12.24.2001 fall?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3149914				0	he	=WEEKNUM_ADD("24.12.2001";1) returns 52.				20200411 15:09:53
