helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148799				0	he	Current Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3125865				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Uses the selected cells as the data source for the pivot table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150011				0	he	The data columns in the pivot table use the same number format as the first data row in the current selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147348				0	he	Data source registered in $[officename]				20200411 15:09:53
