helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10670				0	he	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090102.xhp\" name=\"Pivot table dialog\"\>Pivot table dialog\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
