helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108C9				0	he	Enable drill to details				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108CD				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select this check box and double-click an item label in the table to show or hide details for the item. Clear this check box and double-click a cell in the table to edit the contents of the cell.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
