helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3146786				0	he	LEFT(text; number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147274	99			0	he	\<emph\>text\</emph\> is the text where the initial partial words are to be determined.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153152	100			0	he	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> (optional) specifies the number of characters for the start text. If this parameter is not defined, one character is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150260				0	he	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149141	102			0	he	LEFT("output";3) returns \<emph\>out\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
