helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156008	110			0	he	LEN("Good Afternoon") returns \<emph\>14\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154300	111			0	he	LEN(12345.67) returns \<emph\>8\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
