helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id090720090412378				0	he	=UNICHAR(169) returns the Copyright character \<emph\>©\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id0907200904033543				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>UNICODE function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id0907200904022588				0	he	UNICODE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200904022594				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Returns the numeric code for the first Unicode character in a text string.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
