helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_COUPPCD\"\>Returns the date of the interest date prior to the settlement date. Format the result as a date.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
