helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150541				0	he	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Rows\"\>Rows\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertRows\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts a new row above the active cell.\</ahelp\> The number of rows inserted correspond to the number of rows selected. The existing rows are moved downward.				20200411 15:09:53
