helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3153974				0	he	\<variable id=\"complex\"\>\<emph\>ComplexNumber\</emph\> is a complex number that is entered in the form "x+yi" or "x+yj".\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
