helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3156013	221			0	he	Number: the octal number. The number can have a maximum of 10 places. The most significant bit is the sign bit, the following bits return the value. Negative numbers are entered as two's complement.				20200411 15:09:53
