helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150566				0	he	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3145629				0	he	The inverse hyperbolic cosine of 1 returns the value 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id951567				0	he	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOSH(COSH(4))\</item\> returns 4.				20200411 15:09:53
