helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5834528				0	he	To return the angle in degrees, use the DEGREES function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147538				0	he	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155375				0	he	The inverse cotangent of -1 returns the value 2.36.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8589434				0	he	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(ACOT(1))\</item\> returns 45. The tangent of 45 degrees is 1. 				20200411 15:09:53
