helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Merge Cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149785				0	he	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05060000.xhp\" name=\"Merge Cells\"\>Merge Cells\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151246				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Combines the selected cells into a single cell or splits merged cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	he	The merged cell receives the name of the first cell of the original cell range. Merged cells cannot be merged a second time with other cells. The range must form a rectangle, multiple selection is not supported.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	he	If the cells to be merged have any contents, a security dialog is shown.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Multiple Operations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153381				0	he	Multiple Operations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140				0	he	\<variable id=\"mehrfachoperationen\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TableOperationDialog\"\>Applies the same formula to different cells, but with different parameter values.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	he	The \<emph\>Row\</emph\> or \<emph\>Column\</emph\> box must contain a reference to the first cell of the selected range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	he	If you export a spreadsheet containing multiple operations to Microsoft Excel, the location of the cells containing the formula must be fully defined relative to the data range.				20200411 15:09:53
