helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153550				0	he	Reference operators				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id3149024				0	he	These operators merge cell ranges.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id2324900				0	he	Range has the highest precedence, then intersection, and then finally union.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id3158416				0	he	Operator				20200411 15:09:53
