helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154073				0	he	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145765				0	he	Discount: the percentage discount upon acquisition of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
