helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155542				0	he	Settlement date: March 31 1999, maturity date: June 1 1999, discount: 9 per cent.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154578				0	he	The price of the treasury bill is worked out as follows:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154592				0	he	=TBILLPRICE("3/31/99";"6/1/99"; 0.09) returns 98.45.				20200411 15:09:53
