helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415	3			0	he	The\<emph\> Headers/Footers \</emph\>dialog contains the tabs for defining headers and footers. There will be separate tabs for the left and right page headers and footers if the \<emph\>Same content left/right\</emph\> option was not marked in the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05070000.xhp\" name=\"Page Style\"\>Page Style\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
