helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02190200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145173				0	he	Position the cursor in the cell to the right of the column break indicated by a vertical line and choose \<emph\>Edit - Delete Manual Break - Column Break\</emph\>. The manual column break is removed.				20200411 15:09:53
