helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154684				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>rotating; draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>draw objects; rotating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pivot points of draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>skewing draw objects\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154684				0	he	\<variable id=\"rotate_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/rotate_object.xhp\" name=\"Rotating Objects\"\>סיבוב אובייקטים\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	he	You can rotate an object around its default pivot point (center point) or a pivot point that you designate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	he	\<image id=\"img_id3154729\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154729\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3150716				0	he	Select the object you want to rotate. On the \<emph\>Mode\</emph\> toolbar in $[officename] Draw or on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar in $[officename] Impress, click the \<emph\>Rotate\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149021				0	he	Move the pointer to a corner handle so that the pointer changes to a rotate symbol. Drag the handle to rotate the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id0930200803002335				0	he	Hold down the Shift key to restrict the rotation to multiples of 15 degrees.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id0930200803002463				0	he	Right-click the object to open the context menu. Choose Position and Size - Rotation to enter an exact rotation value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962				0	he	\<image id=\"img_id3154023\" src=\"res/helpimg/rotate.png\" width=\"5.424cm\" height=\"3.916cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154023\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3166424				0	he	To change the pivot point, drag the small circle in the center of the object to a new location.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\rotate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159236				0	he	To skew the object vertically or horizontally, drag one of the side handles.				20200411 15:09:53
