helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10917				0	he	You can add text to any graphic after double-clicking the graphic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id1827448				0	he	To determine the position of the text, use the settings in \<emph\>Format - Text\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147366	59			0	he	For example, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Callouts\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3154508\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_calloutshapes.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154508\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to open the Callouts toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FD				0	he	Select a callout and move the mouse pointer to where you want the callout to start.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150272				0	he	Drag to draw the callout.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id1978514				0	he	Enter the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1091A				0	he	Copying Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10921				0	he	Select the text in your Writer document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10925				0	he	Copy the text to the clipboard (\<emph\>Edit - Copy\</emph\>).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092D				0	he	Click the page or slide where you want to paste the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10931				0	he	Paste the text using \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\> or \<emph\>Edit - Paste special\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1093C				0	he	Using \<emph\>Paste special\</emph\>, you can choose the text format to be pasted. Depending on formats, you can copy different text attributes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN1093F				0	he	Importing Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN10946				0	he	Click the page or slide where you want to import the text.				20200411 15:09:53
