helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveUpSubItems\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves a paragraph with subpoints to above the previous paragraph.\</ahelp\> This is only visible when the cursor is positioned within numbered or bulleted text.				20200411 15:09:53
