helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154504				0	he	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> recognizes the cell range for the sum function as long as the cells are filled with numbers. Prior to entering the data, you must enable the \<emph\>Number Recognition\</emph\> in the context menu of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
