helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145086				0	he	\<variable id=\"load_styles\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/load_styles.xhp\" name=\"Using Styles From Another Document or Template\"\>Using Styles From Another Document or Template\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	he	You can import styles from another document or template into the current document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3155910				0	he	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_idN10703				0	he	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon to open the submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070B				0	he	Choose \<emph\>Load styles\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	he	Use the check boxes at the bottom of the dialog to select the style types that you want to import. To replace styles in the current document that have the same name as the ones you are importing, select \<emph\>Overwrite\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	he	יש לעשות אחת מהדרכים הבאות:				20200411 15:09:53
