helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	he	Place the cursor in your document where you want to insert the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147416				0	he	On the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
