helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145715				0	he	When you insert an object, graphic, or frame, an anchor icon appears where the item is anchored. You can position an anchored item by dragging the item to another location. To change the anchoring options of an item, right-click the item, and then choose an option from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Anchor\</item\> submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	הוספת מספרי שורות				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150101				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>line numbers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text; line numbers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>lines in text; numbering\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbering; lines\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbers; line numbering\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>marginal numbers on text pages\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;line numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150101				0	he	\<variable id=\"numbering_lines\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/numbering_lines.xhp\" name=\"Adding Line Numbers\"\>הוספת מספרי שורות\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149842				0	he	$[officename] can automatically count and add line numbers to the lines in an entire document or to selected paragraphs in your document. Line numbers are included when you print your document, but not when you save the document as HTML. You can specify the line numbering interval, the starting line number, and whether to count blank lines or lines in frames. You can also add a separator between line numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id7184972				0	he	Line numbers are not available in HTML format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153410				0	he	To add line numbers to an entire document:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>כלים - מיספור שורות\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3149612				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>הצג מיספור\</emph\>, ולהתאים את אפשרויות התצוגה לדרישותיך.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3145101				0	he	יש ללחוץ על \<emph\>אישור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156241				0	he	To add line numbers to specific paragraphs:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3156264				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>כלים - מיספור שורות\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153385				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>הצג מיספור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	he	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	he	Right-click the "Default" paragraph style and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150222				0	he	All paragraph styles are based on the "Default" style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	he	Click the \<emph\>Numbering\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150956				0	he	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line Numbering\</item\> area, clear the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</item\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150520				0	he	יש ללחוץ על \<emph\>אישור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151077				0	he	Select the paragraph(s) where you want to add the line numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3151096				0	he	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153733				0	he	Select \<emph\>Include this paragraph in line numbering\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3153758				0	he	יש ללחוץ על \<emph\>אישור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3146864				0	he	You can also create a paragraph style that includes line numbering, and apply it to the paragraphs that you want to add line numbers to.				20200411 15:09:53
