helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Changing the Default Template				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155913				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>default templates; defining\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>defaults; templates\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>templates; default templates\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text;default templates\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155913				0	he	\<variable id=\"template_default\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/template_default.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Default Template\"\>Changing the Default Template\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3145569				0	he	The default template contains the default formatting information for new text documents. If you want, you can create a new template and use it as the default template.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	hd_id6414990				0	he	To Create a Default Template				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149838				0	he	Create a document and the content and formatting styles that you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3156101				0	he	Choose \<emph\>File - Templates - Save\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	he	In the \<emph\>New Template\</emph\> box, type a name for the new template.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	he	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categories\</item\> list, select "My Templates", and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3153140				0	he	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"File - Templates - Organize\"\>\<emph\>File - Templates - Organize\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149952				0	he	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Templates\</item\> list, double-click the "My Templates" folder.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970				0	he	Right-click the template that you created, and choose \<emph\>Set as Default Template\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149620				0	he	Click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149867				0	he	To reset the default template:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3145102				0	he	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"File - Templates - Organize\"\>\<emph\>File - Templates - Organize\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582				0	he	Right-click a text file in any of the two lists, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Reset Default Template - Text Document\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
