helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_update.xhp	0	help	par_id0310200910360780				0	he	Only the manually formatted attributes of the text at the cursor position in the document will be added to the style that is selected in the Styles and Formatting window. Any attributes that were applied as part of a style will not be added to the updated style.				20200411 15:09:53
