helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id8413953				0	he	You want to find all text in your document to which a certain Paragraph Style is assigned, for example the "Heading 2" style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2696920				0	he	Choose Edit - Find & Replace to open the Find & Replace dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
