helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id3231299				0	he	Finding formats				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id8087405				0	he	You want to find all text in your document to which a certain direct character formatting is assigned. 				20200411 15:09:53
