helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id5589159				0	he	To change the measurement units, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</item\>, and then select a new measurement unit in the Settings area. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id9936216				0	he	ניתן לשנות את הסימונים עבור פיסקה שוטפת, או עבור כל הפיסקאות שנבחרו, עבור סיגנון פיסקה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7953123				0	he	You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>. To display the ruler, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Ruler\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4013794				0	he	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for the current paragraph or for all selected paragraphs. You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	he	Right-click a paragraph and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Paragraph Style - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for all paragraphs that have the same Paragraph Style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7271645				0	he	Indents are calculated with respect to the left and right page margins. If you want the paragraph to extend into the page margin, enter a negative number. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	he	The indents are different regarding the writing direction. For example, look at the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before text \</item\>indent value in left-to-right languages. The left edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the left page margin. In right-to-left languages, the right edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the right page margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4186223				0	he	For a hanging indent, enter a positive value for \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before text\</item\> and a negative value for \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>First line\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1491134				0	he	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155919				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>running titles in headers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>floating titles in headers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>headers; chapter information\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>chapter names in headers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>names; chapter names in headers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155919				0	he	\<variable id=\"header_with_chapter\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/header_with_chapter.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer\"\>Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	he	Before you can insert chapter information into a header or footer, you must first set the outline numbering options for the paragraph style that you want to use for chapter titles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154244				0	he	To create a paragraph style for chapter titles:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155874				0	he	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155898				0	he	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select the paragraph style that you want to use for chapter titles, for example, "Heading 1".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147124				0	he	Select the numbering style for the chapter titles in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Number\</item\> box, for example, "1,2,3...".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219				0	he	Type "Chapter" followed by a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150245				0	he	Enter a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>After\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150949				0	he	יש ללחוץ על \<emph\>אישור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150505				0	he	To insert the chapter name and number in a header or a footer:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150527				0	he	Apply the paragraph style that you defined for chapter titles to the chapter headings in your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153729				0	he	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Header\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Footer\</item\>, and then select the page style for the current page from the submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153762				0	he	Click in the header or footer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3146863				0	he	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\> and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Document\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153175				0	he	Click "Chapter" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and "Chapter number and name" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147065				0	he	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147095				0	he	The header on every page that uses the current page style automatically displays the chapter name and number.				20200411 15:09:53
