helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2582476				0	he	Select any rule type below of the "Plain" rule type. This inserts a new paragraph at the position of the cursor. A picture showing a graphical horizontal line is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
