helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149637				0	he	\<variable id=\"numbering_paras\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/numbering_paras.xhp\" name=\"Modifying Numbering in a Numbered List\"\>Modifying Numbering in a Numbered List\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3145092				0	he	You can remove the numbering from a paragraph in a numbered list or change the number that a numbered list starts with.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id2172612				0	he	If you want numbered headings, use the \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\> menu command to assign a numbering to a paragraph style. Do not use the Numbering icon on the Formatting toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145107				0	he	To remove the number from a paragraph in a numbered list:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3156248				0	he	Click in front of the first character of the paragraph that you want to remove the numbering from.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3153366				0	he	יש לעשות אחת מהדרכים הבאות:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3153390				0	he	למחיקת מספר תוך שמירה על תבליט המיקטע, יש ללחוץ על מקש Backspace.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	he	To remove the number and the indent of the paragraph, click the \<emph\>Numbering on/off\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> Bar. If you save the document in HTML format, a separate numbered list is created for the numbered paragraphs that follow the current paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154856				0	he	To change the number that a numbered list starts with:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3155877				0	he	Click anywhere in the numbered list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	he	Choose \<emph\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3148691	22			0	he	Enter the number you want the list to start with in the \<emph\>Start at\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
