helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3150231				0	he	Use the tools to draw a new contour, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Apply\</item\> icon (green check mark).				20200411 15:09:53
