helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	he	Select the text containing the line breaks that you want to remove.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3156253				0	he	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Apply Style\</item\> box on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> bar, choose “Default”.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388				0	he	Choose \<emph\>Format - AutoFormat - Apply\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
