helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id6307260				0	he	If your text document consists only of pages with the same page style, you can change the page properties directly:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id5256508				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>עיצוב - עמוד\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id9681997				0	he	יש לעבור ללשונית \<emph\>עמוד\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id7994323				0	he	תחת \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>סוג נייר\</item\>, יש לבחור "לאורך" או "לרוחב".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id7069002				0	he	יש ללחוץ על \<emph\>אישור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	hd_id4202398				0	he	כדי לשנות את כיוון העמוד לחלק מהעמודים				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	he	$[officename] uses page styles to specify the orientation of the pages in a document. Page styles define more page properties, as for example header and footer or page margins. You can either change the “Default” page style for the current document, or you can define own page styles and apply those page styles to any parts of your text. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id1449324				0	he	At the end of this help page, we'll discuss the scope of page styles in detail. If you are unsure about the page style concept, please read the section at the end of this page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id1480758				0	he	Unlike character styles or paragraph styles, the page styles don't know a hierarchy. You can create a new page style based on the properties of an existing page style, but when you later change the source style, the new page style does not automatically inherit the changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id2962126				0	he	To change the page orientation only for the current page, you first need a page style, then apply that style:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN10727				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>עיצוב - סגנונות ועיצוב\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN10741				0	he	יש ללחוץ על כפתור \<emph\>סגנונות עמוד\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN10749				0	he	Right-click, and choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN10751				0	he	On the \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> tab page, type a name for the page style in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box, for example "My Landscape".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075D				0	he	In the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box, select the page style that you want to apply to the next page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN10775				0	he	יש לעבור ללשונית \<emph\>עמוד\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	he	תחת \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>סוג נייר\</item\>, יש לבחור "לאורך" או "לרוחב".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_idN108AE				0	he	יש ללחוץ על \<emph\>אישור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id1658375				0	he	Now you have defined a proper page style with the name "My Landscape". To apply the new style, double-click the "My Landscape" page style in the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window. All pages in the current scope of page styles will be changed. If you defined the "next style" to be a different style, only the first page of the current scope of page styles will be changed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	hd_id6082949				0	he	The Scope of Page Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id2858668				0	he	You should be aware of the scope of page styles in %PRODUCTNAME. Which pages of your text document get affected by editing a page style?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	hd_id3278603				0	he	One Page Long Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id5169225				0	he	A page style can be defined to span one page only. The “First Page” style is an example. You set this property by defining another page style to be the "next style", on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Page - Organizer\</item\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id6670125				0	he	סיגנון עמוד בעמידה מתחיל מהגבול התחתון של העמוד השוטף עד למעבר העמוד הבא. מעבר העמוד הבא מופיע באופן אוטומאטי כשהטקסט עובר לעמוד הבא (זה נקרא לעיתים "מעבר עמוד רך"). לחילופין ניתן להכניס מעבר עמוד באופן ידני.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id2118594				0	he	To insert a manual page break at the cursor position, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl+Enter\</item\> or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Manual Break\</item\> and just click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	hd_id166020				0	he	Manually Defined Range of a Page style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id6386913				0	he	The “Default” page style does not set a different "next style" on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Page - Organizer\</item\> tab page. Instead, the "next style" is set also to be “Default”. All page styles that are followed by the same page style can span multiple pages. The lower and upper borders of the page style range are defined by "page breaks with style". All the pages between any two "page breaks with style" use the same page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id6062196				0	he	ניתן להכניס "מעבר עמוד עם סיגנון" באופן ישיר במיקום הסמן. לחילופין ניתן להחיל אפשרות "מעבר עמוד עם סיגנון" לפיסקה או לסיגנון פיסקה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id6054261				0	he	בצע אחת מהפקודות שלהלן:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id1811578				0	he	To insert a "page break with style" at the cursor position, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Manual Break\</item\>, select a \<emph\>Style\</emph\> name from the listbox, and click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id9935911				0	he	To apply the "page break with style" property to the current paragraph, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph - Text Flow\</item\>. In the Breaks area, activate \<emph\>Enable\</emph\> and \<emph\>With Page Style\</emph\>. Select a page style name from the listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id4753868				0	he	To apply the "page break with style" property to the current paragraph style, right-click the current paragraph. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Paragraph Style\</item\> from the context menu. Click the \<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\> tab. In the Breaks area, activate \<emph\>Enable\</emph\> and \<emph\>With Page Style\</emph\>. Select a page style name from the listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pageorientation.xhp	0	help	par_id4744407				0	he	To apply the "page break with style" property to an arbitrary paragraph style, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>. Click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles\</emph\> icon. Right-click the name of the paragraph style you want to modify and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. Click the \<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\> tab. In the Breaks area, activate \<emph\>Enable\</emph\> and \<emph\>With Page Style\</emph\>. Select a page style name from the listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	יצירת סגנון עמוד המבוסס על העמוד הנוכחי				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146875				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>כותרות עליונות; הוספה\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>כותרות תחתונות; הוספה\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>סגנונות עמוד; שינוי בהתאם לבחירה\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>סגנונות עמוד חדשים בהתאם לבחירה\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146875				0	he	\<variable id=\"change_header\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/change_header.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page\"\>יצירת סגנון עמוד המבוסס על העמוד הנוכחי\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153584				0	he	באפשרותך ליצור סגנון עמוד המבוסס על עימוד שיצרת.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3154245				0	he	למשל, באפשרותך ליצור סגנון עמוד אחד שמציג כותרת עליונה בצורה מסויימת, וסגנון עמוד עם כותרת עליונה אחרת.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	he	יש לפתוח מסמך-טקסט, לבחור \<emph\>עיצוב - סגנונות ועיצוב\</emph\>, וללחוץ על כפתור \<emph\>סגנונות עמוד\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150532				0	he	יש ללחוץ על כפתור \<emph\>סגנון חדש מהבחירה\</emph\> ובתפריט שניפתח לבחור ב\<emph\>סגנון חדש מהבחירה\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153153				0	he	Type a name for the page in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style name\</item\> box, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153184	32			0	he	כדי לשנות את סגנון העמוד לסגנון זה יש ללחוץ לחיצה-כפולה על שמו מתוך הרשימה. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155541				0	he	יש ללחוץ על \<emph\>הוספה - כותרת עליונה\</emph\>, ולבחור מהרשימה את סגנון העמוד.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155572				0	he	יש להקליד את הטקסט שיופיע בכותרת העליונה. יש למקם את הסמן באזור הטקסט של המסמך ומחוץ לכותרת.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155592				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>הוספה - מעבר יזום\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147771				0	he	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page break\</item\> and then select “Default” from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147810				0	he	כדי ליצור סגנון עמוד נוסף עם כותרת-עליונה שונה יש לחזור על שלבים 2-6.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	Inserting Hyperlinks With the Navigator				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155845				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>hyperlinks; inserting from Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting; hyperlinks from Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cross-references; inserting with Navigator\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;hyperlinks\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Navigator;inserting hyperlinks\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155845				0	he	\<variable id=\"hyperlinks\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hyperlinks.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Hyperlinks With the Navigator\"\>Inserting Hyperlinks With the Navigator\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858				0	he	You can insert a cross-reference as a hyperlink in your document using the Navigator. You can even cross-reference items from other \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> documents. If you click the hyperlink when the document is opened in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>, you are taken to the cross-referenced item.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3149833				0	he	Open the document(s) containing the items you want to cross-reference.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3148846				0	he	On the Standard bar, click the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3156108				0	he	Click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Drag Mode\</item\> icon, and ensure that \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert as Hyperlink\</item\> is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153396				0	he	In the list at the bottom of the Navigator, select the document containing the item that you want to cross-reference.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	he	In the Navigator list, click the plus sign next to the item that you want to insert as a hyperlink.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153133				0	he	Drag the item to where you want to insert the hyperlink in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3149635				0	he	The name of the item is inserted in the document as an underlined hyperlink.				20200411 15:09:53
