helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147267				0	he	הרץ תסריט-פעולה				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147290				0	he	מריץ תסריט-פעולה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145614				0	he	שדה קלט				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145637				0	he	פותח תיבת-שיח לעריכת תוכן השדה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	he	Placeholder, hidden text, insert reference, variable, database, and user-defined fields display a help tip when you rest the mouse pointer over the field in a document. To enable this feature, ensure that the Extended Tips option (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>What's This?\</item\>) is selected in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help\</item\> menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155937				0	he	עדכון שדות				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155963				0	he	כדי לעדכן את כל השדות במסמך, יש ללחוץ על F9, או לבחור \<emph\>עריכה - בחר הכל\</emph\>, וללחוץ F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155984				0	he	כדי לעדכן שדה שהוסף ממסד-נתונים, יש לבחור את השדה, וללחוץ על F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	About Headers and Footers				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155863				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>headers;about\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>footers;about\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>HTML documents; headers and footers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155863				0	he	\<variable id=\"header_footer\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/header_footer.xhp\" name=\"About Headers and Footers\"\>About Headers and Footers\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	he	Headers and footers are areas in the top and the bottom page margins, where you can add text or graphics. Headers and footers are added to the current page style. Any page that uses the same style automatically receives the header or footer that you add. You can insert \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>Fields\</link\>, such as page numbers and chapter headings, in headers and footers in a text document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3150511				0	he	The page style for the current page is displayed in the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	he	To add a header to a page, choose \<emph\>Insert - Header\</emph\>, and then select the page style for the current page from the submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3147119				0	he	To add a footer to a page, choose \<emph\>Insert - Footer\</emph\>, and then select the page style for the current page from the submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	he	You can also choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Page\</item\>, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Header\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Footer\</item\> tab, and then select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Header on\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Footer on\</item\>. Clear the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Same content left/right\</item\> check box if you want to define different headers and footers for even and odd pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3146876				0	he	To use different headers or footers in your document, you must add them to different \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/header_pagestyles.xhp\" name=\"Page Styles\"\>Page Styles\</link\>, and then apply the styles to the pages where you want the headers or footer to appear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150704				0	he	Headers and Footers in HTML Documents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717	34			0	he	Some of the header and footer options are also available for HTML documents. Headers and footers are not supported by HTML and instead are exported with special tags, so that they can be viewed in a browser. Headers and footers are only exported in HTML documents if they are enabled in Web Layout mode. When you reopen the document in $[officename], the headers and footers are displayed correctly, including any fields that you inserted. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_footer.xhp	0	help	par_id3153174				0	he	\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/header_pagestyles.xhp\" name=\"Page Styles\"\>Page Styles\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	הצגת תוצאת החישוב של טבלה בטבלה אחרת				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153899				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>חישוב;בטבלאות טקסט\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>טבלאות; ביצוע חישובים ב-\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153899				0	he	\<variable id=\"calculate_intext2\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_intext2.xhp\" name=\"Displaying the Result of a Table Calculation in a Different Table\"\>הצגת תוצאת החישוב של טבלה בטבלה אחרת\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	he	אפשר לבצע חישוב לתאים בטבלה אחת ולהציג את התוצאה בטבלה אחרת.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	he	יש לפתוח מסמך-טקסט, להוסיף טבלה עם מספר עמודות או שורות, וטבלה נוספת בעלת תא אחד.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150528				0	he	יש להקליד מספרים שונים בחלק מהתאים שבטבלה הגדולה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155532				0	he	יש למקם את הסמן בטבלה בעלת התא היחיד, וללחוץ על F2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155551				0	he	בסרגל ה\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>נוסחה\</item\>, יש להקליד את הפונקציה לחישוב, למשל, \<item type=\"literal\"\>=SUM\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	he	יש ללחוץ על תא בטבלה הגדולה שמכיל מספר, ללחוץ על סימן החיבור (+), ולהמשיך כך עם יתר התאים שמכילים מספרים.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155598				0	he	יש ללחוץ \<emph\>Enter\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	he	אפשר לגרום לטבלה להשתלב ברצף הטקסט של המסמך. לצורך כך יש להוסיף את הטבלה לתוך אזור-תחום, ולעגן את האזור-התחום כתו. האזור-התחום שמכיל את הטבלה יוצמד לטקסט ויזוז עם הוספת או מחיקת טקסט בסמוך לו.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	tit				0	he	הוספת מסמך טקסט שלם				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155185				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>מקטעים;הוספת תוכן חיצוני\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>מסמכי טקסט;מיזוג\</bookmark_value\>        \<bookmark_value\>קישורים;הוספת מסמכי-טקסט כ-\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>הוספה;מסמכי-טקסט\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155185				0	he	\<variable id=\"textdoc_inframe\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/textdoc_inframe.xhp\" name=\"Inserting an Entire Text Document\"\>הוספת מסמך-טקסט שלם\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id1812799				0	he	כדי להוסיף קובץ טקסט				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	he	יש למקם את הסמן במקום בו יתווסף הקובץ למסמך.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412				0	he	יש לבחור \<emph\>הוספה - קובץ\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149839				0	he	Locate the text document that you want to insert, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3148858				0	he	The contents of the text document are embedded into the current document and are not updated if the source file is changed. If you want the contents to automatically update when you change the source document, insert the file as a link.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156105				0	he	Inserting an Entire Text Document as a Link				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3150096				0	he	Place the cursor in the document where you want to insert the file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	he	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Section\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	he	Type a name in the \<emph\>New Section\</emph\> box, and then select the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642				0	he	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File Name\</item\> box, type the name of the file that you want to insert, or click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and locate the file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968				0	he	If the target text document contains sections, you can select the section that you want to insert in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sections\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149619				0	he	If you want, set the formatting options for the section.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149862				0	he	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	he	$[officename] automatically updates the contents of the inserted section whenever the source document is changed. To manually update the contents of the section, choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - Update All\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
