helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149688				0	he	\<variable id=\"insert_beforetable\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_beforetable.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Text Before a Table at the Top of Page\"\>Inserting Text Before a Table at the Top of Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3155923				0	he	If you want to insert text before a table that is at the top of a page, click in the first cell of the table, in front of any contents of that cell, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	par_idN10612				0	he	To insert text after a table at the end of the document, go to the last cell of the table and press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
