helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149818				0	he	You can apply numbering to a paragraph manually or with a paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id6140629				0	he	להוספת מספור באופן ידני				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155866				0	he	To apply numbering manually, click in the paragraph, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering On/Off\</item\> icon on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153405				0	he	You cannot apply manual numbering to paragraphs that are listed under "Special Styles" in the Styles and Formatting window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10711				0	he	When you press Enter in a numbered or bulleted list, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically numbers the next paragraph. To remove the numbering or bullet from the new paragraph, press Enter again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	he	To change the hierarchical level of a bullet in a list, click in front of the paragraph, then press the Tab key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072F				0	he	To change the bullets or numbering format for the current paragraph only, select a character or word in the paragraph, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a new format. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10733				0	he	To change the bullet or numbering format for all paragraphs in the list, ensure that the cursor is in the list, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a new format. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	he	To apply the same bullet or numbering format to all paragraphs in the list, select all paragraphs, choose Bullets and Numbering, and then click a format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073A				0	he	ניתן להשתמש בפקודות בסרגל הכלים \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Object Bar\"\>תבליטים ומספור\</link\> כדי לערוך רשימת מספור או תבליטים. כדי לשנות את המספור או את סגנון התבליט, לחץ על הצלמית \<emph\>תבליטים ומספור\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153123				0	he	To apply numbering with a Paragraph Style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153137				0	he	Paragraph Styles give you greater control over numbering that you apply in a document. When you change the numbering format of the style, all paragraphs using the style are automatically updated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149646				0	he	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paragraph Styles\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149599				0	he	Right-click the paragraph style that you want to apply numbering to, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149850				0	he	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Outline & Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874				0	he	In the \<emph\>Numbering Styles\</emph\> box, select the type of numbering that you want to use.				20200411 15:09:53
