helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155565				0	he	You can also click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formula\</item\> icon on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formula Bar\</item\>, and then choose a function for your formula.				20200411 15:09:53
