helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153641				0	he	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090002.xhp\" name=\"Cross-references\"\>Cross-references\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155142				0	he	\<variable id=\"reftext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is where you insert the references or referenced fields into the current document. References are referenced fields within the same document or within sub-documents of a master document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3159197				0	he	The advantage of entering a cross-reference as a field is that you do not have to adjust the references manually every time you change the document. Just update the fields with F9 and the references in the document are updated too.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	hd_id4333628				0	he	Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id4516129				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the Selection list, and then click Insert.\</ahelp\> The following fields are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3151380				0	he	Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150700				0	he	Meaning				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155862				0	he	Set Reference				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	he	Set target for a referenced field. Under \<emph\>Name\</emph\>, enter a name for the reference. When inserting the reference, the name will then appear as an identification in the list box \<emph\>Selection\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149556				0	he	In an HTML document, reference fields entered this way will be ignored. For the target in HTML documents, you have to \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04040000.xhp\" name=\"insert a bookmark\"\>insert a bookmark\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150548				0	he	Insert Reference				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147746				0	he	Inserting a reference to another position in the document. The corresponding text position has to be defined with "Set Reference" first. Otherwise, inserting a reference by choosing a field name under \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> is not possible.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146344				0	he	In master documents, you can also reference from one sub-document to another. Note that the reference name will not appear in the selection field and has to be entered "by hand".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149847				0	he	In an HTML document, reference fields entered this way will be ignored. For referenced fields in HTML documents, you have to \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020400.xhp\" name=\"insert a hyperlink\"\>insert a hyperlink\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id2408825				0	he	Headings				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id9988402				0	he	תיבת הבחירה מראה רשימה של כל הכותרות לפי סדר הופעתן במסמך.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id6401257				0	he	פיסקאות ממוספרות				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id5841242				0	he	תיבת הבחירה מראה רשימה של כל הכותרות הממוספרות והפיסקאות הממוספרות לפי סדר הופעתן במסמך.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id306711				0	he	Bookmarks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150907				0	he	After inserting a bookmark in the document with \<emph\>Insert - Bookmark\</emph\>, the bookmarks entry on the \<emph\>References\</emph\> tab becomes usable. Bookmarks are used to mark certain text passages in a document. In a text document, you can use the bookmarks, for example, to jump from one passage in the document to another.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155080				0	he	In an HTML document, these bookmarks become anchors <A name>, which determine the target of hyperlinks for example.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200811011072				0	he	Footnotes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200811011049				0	he	If your documents contains a footnote, you can select the Footnotes entry. A reference to a footnote returns the footnote number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id6794030				0	he	הכנס אובייקט עם אותיות גדולות (עבור כתב לטיני)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id7096774				0	he	ניתן לקבוע קישורים יחסיים לאובייקטים שיש בהם אותיות גדולות. למשל בעת הכנסת תמונה, לחץ לחיצת עכבר ימנית עליה ובחר "אותיות גדולות" (אם האפשרות קיימת). כעת האובייקט מופיע כשהוא ממוספר בתור דוגמה ברשימה.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154772				0	he	References are fields. To remove a reference, delete the field. If you set a longer text as a reference and you do not want to reenter it after deleting the reference, select the text and copy it to the clipboard. You can then reinsert it as "unformatted text" at the same position using the command \<emph\>Edit - Paste special\</emph\>. The text remains intact while the reference is deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	hd_id5824152				0	he	Selection				20200411 15:09:53
