helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge07.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055D				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Minimizes the wizard so that you can edit the mail merge document for a single recipient.\</ahelp\> After you made your changes, click the \<emph\>Return to Mail Merge Wizard\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
