helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145412				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SendAbstractToStarImpre\"\>Opens the current document as a $[officename] Impress presentation. The current document must contain at least one predefined heading paragraph style.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149801				0	he	Included Outline Levels				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\01160400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153667				0	he	Enter the number of outline levels to include in the new presentation. For example, if you choose one level, only the paragraphs that follow the "Heading 1" paragraph style are included.				20200411 15:09:53
