helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148841	76			0	he	In the\<emph\> Database selection\</emph\> box, double-click an address book, click "First Name", and then click\<emph\> Insert\</emph\>. Repeat for "Last Name".				20200411 15:09:53
