helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05200000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154652				0	he	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05200000.xhp\" name=\"Merge Table\"\>Merge Table\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147401				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MergeTable\"\>Combines two consecutive tables into a single table. The tables must be directly next to each other and not separated by an empty paragraph.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146325				0	he	If you choose this command when the cursor is in the middle of three consecutive tables, you are prompted to select the table that you want to merge with.				20200411 15:09:53
