helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_RADIOBUTTON_TP_FRM_STD_RB_ANCHOR_PARA\"\>Anchors the selection to the current paragraph.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
