helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149558				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_FLD_FUNC_PB_LISTREMOVE\"\>Removes the selected item from the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
