helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148886	25			0	he	For user-defined fields, click the format that you want to apply in the \<emph\>Format \</emph\>list, or click "Additional formats" to define a custom format.				20200411 15:09:53
