helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149493				0	he	Character Style for main entries				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3149109				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:LB_MAIN_ENTRY_STYLE\"\>Specify the formatting style for the main entries in the alphabetical index. To convert an index entry into a main entry, click in front of the index field in the document and then choose \<emph\>Edit - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120100.xhp\" name=\"Index Entry\"\>\<emph\>Index Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148977				0	he	Alphabetical delimiter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:CB_ALPHADELIM\"\>Uses the initial letters of the alphabetically arranged index entries as section headings.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	he	Key separated by commas				20200411 15:09:53
