helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	bm_id4005249				0	he	\<bookmark_value\>styles;categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>character styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraph styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>frames; styles\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbering styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150344				0	he	Styles in Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149052				0	he	The following information concerns Writer styles that you can apply using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150015				0	he	If you want, you can edit the styles of the current document, and then save the document as a template. To save the document as template, choose \<emph\>File - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110300.xhp\" name=\"Templates - Save\"\>\<emph\>Templates - Save\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150572				0	he	Style Category				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153721				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:RID_STYLECATALOG:BT_TOOL\"\>These are the different categories of formatting styles.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151271				0	he	Name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153154				0	he	Description				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172	6			0	he	Character Styles 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	he	Use Character Styles to format single characters, or entire words and phrases. If you want, you can nest Character Styles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150713	8			0	he	Paragraph Styles 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	he	Use Paragraph Styles to format paragraphs, including the font type and size. You can also select the paragraph style to apply to the next paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308				0	he	Frame Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147527				0	he	Use Frame Styles to format text and graphic frames.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	12			0	he	Page Styles 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897				0	he	Use Page Styles to organize the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196	63			0	he	Numbering Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149298	64			0	he	Use Numbering Styles to format numbered or bulleted lists.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149821				0	he	Style Groups				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154828				0	he	These are the style groups that you can display in the Styles and Formatting window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148977				0	he	Name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149032				0	he	Meaning				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153642				0	he	Automatic				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152769				0	he	Displays styles appropriate to the current context.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154374				0	he	All Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	he	Displays all styles of the active style category.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150590				0	he	Applied Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168	24			0	he	Displays the styles (of selected category) applied in the current document. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156368				0	he	Custom Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145780				0	he	Displays all user-defined styles in the selected style category.				20200411 15:09:53
