helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167	2			0	he	\<variable id=\"fussnoteein\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFootnote\"\>Inserts a footnote or an endnote in the document. The anchor for the note is inserted at the current cursor position.\</ahelp\> You can choose between automatic numbering or a custom symbol. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154645	23			0	he	\<variable id=\"endnoten\"\>The following applies to both footnotes and endnotes. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
