helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	he	תאריך				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	he	Inserts the current date. You can insert the date as a fixed field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date (fixed)\</item\> - that does not change, or as a dynamic field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date\</item\> - that it is updated automatically. To manually update the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date\</item\> field, press F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	he	שם הקובץ				20200411 15:09:53
