helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804290272				0	he	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available fields for the field type selected in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list. To insert a field, click the field, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149956				0	he	For the "Created", "Modified", and "Last printed" field types, you can include the author, date, and time of the corresponding operation.				20200411 15:09:53
