helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	he	\<variable id=\"tabelle_tastatur\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090201.xhp\" name=\"Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\"\>Editing Tables Using the Keyboard\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145244				0	he	You can resize and delete table columns with the keyboard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150564				0	he	Resizing Columns and Rows				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153920				0	he	To resize a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down Alt, and then press the left or the right arrow. To resize the column without changing the width of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the left or the right arrows.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147566				0	he	To increase the left indent of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the right arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150759				0	he	To resize a row, place the cursor in the row, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the up or the down arrows.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149286				0	he	To move the table downwards on the page, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the down arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	he	Inserting and deleting columns or rows				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	he	To insert a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940				0	he	To delete a column, place the cursor in the column that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	he	To insert a row, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153531				0	he	To delete a row, place the cursor in the row that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150983				0	he	To change the behavior of tables in a text document, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040500.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Table\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196				0	he	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0204.xhp\" name=\"Table Bar\"\>Table Bar\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
