helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149558				0	he	List box				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145257				0	he	Lists the AutoText categories. To view the AutoText entries in a category, double-click the category, or click the plus sign (+) in front of the category. To insert an AutoText entry into the current document, select the entry in the list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153300				0	he	You can drag and drop AutoText entries from one category to another.				20200411 15:09:53
